{"id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:cw-pair","title":"def:cw-pair","path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.md","line":214,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex#def:cw-pair","uses":["[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:subcomplex]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex","label":"def:cw-pair","line":310,"source":"\\begin{definition}[CW pair]\n\\label{def:cw-pair}\n\\uses{def:subcomplex}\n\\group{CW Complexes}\n\n\nA pair $(X,A)$ consisting of a CW complex and a subcomplex is a \\textbf{CW pair}.\n\\end{definition}\n\nThe closure of a cell need not be a subcomplex: attach a 2-cell to the minimal CW\nstructure on $S^1$ by a map whose image is a proper nontrivial arc; the 2-cell closure\ncontains only part of the 1-cell.","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[CW pair] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a63772d70616972\"></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter0%23def%3Asubcomplex\">↗ def:subcomplex</a> \\group CW Complexes <p></p>A pair <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(X,A)$\">$(X,A)$</span> consisting of a CW complex and a subcomplex is a <strong>CW pair</strong>.  <p></p>The closure of a cell need not be a subcomplex: attach a 2-cell to the minimal CW structure on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$S^1$\">$S^1$</span> by a map whose image is a proper nontrivial arc; the 2-cell closure contains only part of the 1-cell.","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:subcomplex","next":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#rem:closure-of-cell-not-always-subcomplex","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:subcomplex","title":"def:subcomplex","label":"def:subcomplex"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:quotient-cw-structure","title":"def:quotient-cw-structure","label":"def:quotient-cw-structure"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#prop:collapsing-contractible-cw-subcomplex","title":"prop:collapsing-contractible-cw-subcomplex","label":"prop:collapsing-contractible-cw-subcomplex"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#prop:attaching-homotopic-maps-preview","title":"prop:attaching-homotopic-maps-preview","label":"prop:attaching-homotopic-maps-preview"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#ex:quotient-contractible-subcomplex-mapping-cone","title":"ex:quotient-contractible-subcomplex-mapping-cone","label":"ex:quotient-contractible-subcomplex-mapping-cone"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#prop:cw-pairs-have-hep","title":"prop:cw-pairs-have-hep","label":"prop:cw-pairs-have-hep"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#prop:attaching-maps-homotopic-rel-x0","title":"prop:attaching-maps-homotopic-rel-x0","label":"prop:attaching-maps-homotopic-rel-x0"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#ex:sphere-two-points-identified","title":"ex:sphere-two-points-identified","label":"ex:sphere-two-points-identified"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#cor:excision-cw-subcomplexes","title":"cor:excision-cw-subcomplexes","label":"cor:excision-cw-subcomplexes"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:cw-pair","title":"def:cw-pair","tex":"\\begin{definition}[CW pair]\n\\label{def:cw-pair}\n\\uses{def:subcomplex}\n\\group{CW Complexes}\n\n\nA pair $(X,A)$ consisting of a CW complex and a subcomplex is a \\textbf{CW pair}.\n\\end{definition}\n\nThe closure of a cell need not be a subcomplex: attach a 2-cell to the minimal CW\nstructure on $S^1$ by a map whose image is a proper nontrivial arc; the 2-cell closure\ncontains only part of the 1-cell.","source":"tex/references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:subcomplex","title":"def:subcomplex","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}